  lib_link_lib.adam - the lib of lib_link (PLAN-ADAM M8d): built only; its
  build writes liblib_link_lib.a (its module, its start, its own units) and
  the runtime's libadamrt.a into the output folder's
  lib\x86_64-windows-gnu\debug\
